    "detailed_description": "Have you ever dreamed of creating your dream home? I bet you do. Look no further since this game exactly does what you want i.e. building your dream home without the monetary investments and other hassles of real life.<br><br>Use hundreds of objects and arrange them exactly as you'd like your house to be while listening to a relaxing soundtrack. Once you are happy with the design feel free to share with the community.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Some of the features of this game are :- </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Design Freedom - Design your own layout. We give you complete freedom to layout your rooms.<br></li><li> Furnishing - Place furniture and different objects from the library to furnish the rooms.<br></li><li> Painting - Paint the walls , Color the furniture as you see fit.<br></li><li> Sharing - Once you are happy with the layout you can share the rooms with the community, friends and family.<br></li><li> Customization - You can customize the weather , ambient color and many more in the game.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Have you ever dreamed of creating your dream home? I bet you do. Look no further since this game exactly does what you want i.e. building your dream home without the monetary investments and other hassles of real life.<br><br>Use hundreds of objects and arrange them exactly as you'd like your house to be while listening to a relaxing soundtrack. Once you are happy with the design feel free to share with the community.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Some of the features of this game are :- </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Design Freedom - Design your own layout. We give you complete freedom to layout your rooms.<br></li><li> Furnishing - Place furniture and different objects from the library to furnish the rooms.<br></li><li> Painting - Paint the walls , Color the furniture as you see fit.<br></li><li> Sharing - Once you are happy with the layout you can share the rooms with the community, friends and family.<br></li><li> Customization - You can customize the weather , ambient color and many more in the game.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "My Cozy Home is a relaxing house building game where you get to build the house you always dreamed of. The game offers a huge library of items to create a bedroom or a kitchen or a gaming room or anything you can dream of. Choice is yours. Add to Wishlist now!",
